Option B is what "small Lean compatibility module" means and is feasible. The key compile-checked artifacts:
1. `upstreamEvans_heatKernelSpatial_eq_gaussianKernel`: upstream `heatKernelSpatial` (transcribed verbatim) equals local `Poincare.D10.HeatKernelEuclidean.gaussianKernel` — by rfl basically (both are `(4πt)^(-n/2) exp(-‖x‖²/(4t))`). 
